<view class="page page-motion"><view class="title">活动折扣</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{authorized}}" class="card space-top"><view class="muted">当前：{{current}}</view><view class="label">全店折扣</view><view class="row"><input class="field grow" type="digit" value="{{discount}}" bindinput="field" disabled="{{busy}}" placeholder="自由填写，例如8.8"/><text>折</text></view><view class="note">8.8折就是原价的88%；10折就是原价。</view><view wx:if="{{preview}}" class="hero"><view class="section">{{preview}}</view><view>原价 ¥100.00 → 售价 <text class="price">¥{{examplePrice}}</text></view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy || !preview}}" loading="{{busy}}" hover-start-time="30" hover-stay-time="80">保存折扣</button><view class="note space-top">保存后适用于所有商品和新订单。已下单金额保持不变。商品实付合计满69元包邮，未满收5元，自取免运费。</view></view></view>
